      {
        "image": "/media/wildkumaon-resort-img.jpg",
        "text": "Nature enterprises and sustainable practices. Wild Kumaon Brings you the Nature experiences of Sattal.",
        "link": null
      },
      {
        "image": "/media/home-slider-2.jpg",
        "text": "Wild Kumaon is preferred by Nature lovers, Bird watchers and anyone who wants to get surrounded by Peace and Trees.",
        "link": null
      },
      {
        "image": "/media/green-tailed-sunbird.jpg",
        "text": "Sattal – Home for more than 250 species and an ultimate destination for birders.",
        "link": null
      },
      {
        "image": "/media/room-img-1.jpg",
        "text": "healthy accommodation with all standard amenities, comfort inside – wild outside",
        "link": null
      },
      {
        "image": "/media/wildkumaon-resort.jpg",
        "text": "WILD KUMAON- An Eco-Resort at Sattal It is one of the purely dedicated Wildlife Lodges in Uttarakhand, Himalayas, India. The team is dedicated to hosting a guest in ethical ways and eco-friendly practices. This place to stay is preferred by Nature Lovers and guests who want to accommodate themselves in a fresh environment and only between a few people. Accommodation is perfect if you are visiting Sattal to enjoy its birds and Nature. Wild Kumaon also loves to host on monthly basis, long stays in a Homestay manner for Work from Hills/Work from Home. Know More AMENITIES Providing Hospitality the correct way Kettle Laundry Wi-Fi Heater Hot Water Car Rentel RO Water Wi-fi High Speed Linens Fine Dinning Toiletries Parking Area Freshwater lakes nearby We are a choice of Bird Watchers and preferred by Nature Lovers, this Summer we are looking to host people who choose to stay longer, our team is dedicated to providing them with the beautiful hosting experience. Nearby Places are lakes, forests and the serene nature of Sattal, Bhimtal. Be a free bird in the Kumaon further Kumaon visits and tours designed with a decade of experience of Naturalist…call or make an enquiry to know more. Make An Enquiry Packages Work from Hills A stunning_location, not to mention the high-speed internet. Amidst_nature and with modern_amenities, close_to_Delhi. Wild Kumaon is all set to make you experience Sattal and take care of you on your remote working. Enquiry Kumaon Culture with us on weekends. Curated local, cultural and heritage experiences of the Kumaon region. Enquiry Camping and Adventure in Kumaon. Adventure is a necessity and we never forget it! Enquiry Birding Tours Target Oriented, Beginners or Photography focused… our dedicated team designs and deliver the tour you want Enquiry GALLERY TESTIMONIALS",
        "link": "/media/open-area-img.jpg"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "index-hero-2",
    "page": "/",
    "type": "content-slider",
    "settings": {
      "slidesToShow": 1,
