    "slides": [
      {
        "image": null,
        "text": "Wild Kumaon is where you want to stay in Sattal. Below are various points which I think works in favour of them... 1. New property 2. Humble people 3. Good jungle environment 4. Good food 5. Learned naturalist 6. Good bird sighting within the premises I really enjoyed my stay there...before staying here I stayed at some other property in Sattal. I am glad I shifted here. Do visit there and enjoy the hospitality of Wild Kumaon!!!​ Dheeraj Mrig",
        "link": null
      },
      {
        "image": null,
        "text": "We had this wonderful tour with Ankit Das Loiwal' in late March to Chopta, a team of 'Wild Kumaon'. 'Ankit' the tour leader made us experience wonderful sightings, well behaviour, comfortable and deep birding. we will always go with 'Ankit Das' from now on, really appreciate his field work and the gentle approach towards birds. We made really good photographs of higher altitude rare birds. Thankyou 'Wild Kumaon' and 'Ankit Das Loiwal' for this amazing tour. Looking forward for my next visit to Sattal and Uttarakhand. Mitesh Patel",
        "link": null
      },
      {
        "image": null,
        "text": "We have recently been to Wild Kumaon, Sattal. It was an awesome experience... Location, ambiance, space, cleanliness are more than what I had expected. Simply great site on best location. Highly recommended to friends interested in birding. Special mention of Mr. Gopal alongwith Madan bhai for taking good care with delicious kumaoni food. A very soft spoken and knowledgeable naturalist Ankit das. Looking forward to visit again. Kanchan Zambre",
        "link": null
      },
      {
        "image": null,
        "text": "Awesome experience... We have recently been to Wild Kumaon, Sattal. The place is fantastic, a nature lover's paradise. One can hear the chirping of the birds from morning till evening. We had the most hospitable hosts, very friendly, caring, and served very delicious food (special thanks for Kumaonis food). One can have the feeling of a family in this beautiful place. Highly recommended this stay. Thanks to Neer and the team for being an awesome host at Wild Kumaon Daljeet Dhillon View More Ask Your Queries Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form. Name * Numbers of Persons * Email * Mobile * Message Message Send Ask Your Queries Want to Know more about your stay at Wild Kumaon, Bird Watching Package, fill the adjacent form Or Make A Booking Partners &amp; Associations Mob. - 9520017658 , 8433240272, 8937870470 Email. wildkumaon@gmail.com Address: WildKumaon, Sattal",
        "link": "/guest-book"
      }
    ]
  },
